 the last few nm are approximated on the 5 nm grid.","Spectral dye density plot has only 'mid' (\u4e2d\u9593\u6fc3\u5ea6, density given by a neutral subject) and 'min' (\u6700\u5c0f\u6fc3\u5ea6, minimum density), no separate c/m/y dyes; the curves run 400-720 nm. The page contains the same two paths drawn twice.","Grain: diffuse RMS granularity 4 (printed as '\u2026\u20264' next to heading 18); micro-densitometer aperture 48 um, sample density minimum density + 1.0. Film speed ISO 400/27 deg daylight (tungsten 3200 K: ISO 100 with LBB-12). No paper is recommended on the sheet."],"print":"kodak-endura-premier","grain":{"grain":16.0,"grain_size":32.0,"grain_roughness":50.0}}